{"version":1,"content":"<p>歐盟委員會已暫時關閉歐盟學院（EU Academy）的公眾訪問權限，原因是該在線學習平台遭遇網絡攻擊，並已確認造成用户個人信息泄露。歐盟學院是歐盟官方的在線教育平台，面向學生、非政府組織工作人員、公共部門專業人士及普通公眾，提供與歐盟政策相關的課程、研討會和教學資源。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587734.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:43:55.434547+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":139,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:28:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_hash":"3fe77b9ad5e242408b8006367d50351bce383eb9bb727b914c953181fc54e0ba","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}